:12070367,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4AuC3f","number":22,"title":"4.5","description":"","creator":{"login":"Sauermann","id":6299227,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYyOTkyMjc=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/6299227?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann","html_url":"https://github.com/Sauermann","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"open_issues":3,"closed_issues":3687,"state":"closed","created_at":"2024-12-19T08:51:28Z","updated_at":"2026-09-04T21:48:38Z","due_on":"2025-09-15T00:00:00Z","closed_at":"2025-09-18T17:13:14Z"},"comments":31,"created_at":"2025-03-14T20:57:54Z","updated_at":"2025-03-24T00:03:19Z","closed_at":"2025-03-16T00:45:45Z","assignee":{"login":"dsnopek","id":191561,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5MTU2MQ==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/191561?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek","html_url":"https://github.com/dsnopek","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"author_association":"NONE","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\nReproducible in: 4.4 stable & 4.4-rc1\nNot reproducible in: 4.3 stable\n\n### System information\n\nGodot v4.4.1.rc1 - macOS Sequoia (15.3.1) - Multi-window, 1 monitor - Metal (Mobile) - integrated Apple M3 Pro (Apple9) - Apple M3 Pro (12 threads)\n\n### Issue description\n\nFollowing the regression in [this issue](https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/103720), there are still other issues not fixed in the same plugin due to (surely) the same regression.\n\nPlugin is AdMob from Poing Studios: \nhttps://github.com/poingstudios/godot-admob-plugin\n\nThe error is: \nTrying to assign value of type 'Object' to a variable of type 'Dictionary'\n\nSeveral functions are returning a Dictionary but since Godot 4.4-stable version, Godot seems to expect an Object.\nIt crashes at runtime, preventing from exporting a working Android build.\n\nCreator of the plugin was saying in previous issue 103720:\n\n> I noticed that this error only happens with dictionaries, but I didn't change anything in my plugin. This error only occurs in Godot version 4.4\n\nExample of gd file of the plugin where the issue is happening:\nhttps://github.com/poingstudios/godot-admob-plugin/blob/master/addons/admob/src/api/core/AdSize.gd\n\n> static func get_portrait_anchored_adaptive_banner_ad_size(width : int) -> AdSize:\n\tif _plugin:\n\t\tvar ad_size_dictionary : Dictionary = _plugin.getPortraitAnchoredAdaptiveBannerAdSize(width)\n\t\treturn _create(ad_size_dictionary)\n\treturn AdSize.new(0, 0)\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\nhttps://github.com/poingstudios/godot-admob-plugin\n\nFollow the tutorial: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=WpVGn7ZasKM&feature=youtu.be\n\nJust try to use the plugin on the Sample scene.\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\nCan't provide; you must build your own\n\nBut the project is here: https://github.com/poingstudios/godot-admob-plugin","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/104150/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/104150/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed","pinned_comment":null}